<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29823" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mulctra</span></b> , ae, f.
		mulgeo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a milkingpail, milk-pail</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bis venit ad mulctram,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					E. 3, 30</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">e mulctrā recens caseus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					8, 17, 13</span></i>
			; cf. mulctrum.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>the milk in a
				milk-pail</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 7, 8, 1</span></i>; cf. mulctrum.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
